{"availability":"available","full":"brejeshbalakrishnan/brejeshbalakrishnan.github.io","name":"brejeshbalakrishnan.github.io","description":"Modern Next.js portfolio website showcasing ML/Data Science projects and professional experience. Features interactive project cards, responsive design, project filtering, live demos, and GitHub integration. Built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and optimized for recruiter engagement.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-28T17:00:05Z","updated":"2026-08-10T17:05:59Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://brej-29.github.io/brej-portfolio/","topics":["data-science","frontend","github-actions","github-integration","machine-learning","nextjs","personal-website","portfolio","project-showcase","react","responsive-design","tailwind-css","typescript","web-development"],"demo":"https://brej-29.github.io/brej-portfolio/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.497Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.497Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.497Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.497Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Premium dark-mode, Excel-driven Next.js portfolio for Brejesh Balakrishnan — neon glass UI, recruiter-ready pages, and static-export hosting on GitHub Pages.","Next.js 16 (export) | React 19 | TypeScript | Tailwind CSS v4 | Radix UI | shadcn/ui | Framer Motion | Zod | xlsx | Vercel Analytics","Brej Portfolio is a statically exported Next.js 16 site showcasing Brejesh Balakrishnan (Data Scientist / ML Engineer / Full-Stack Developer). It ships with a premium dark, glassmorphism-inspired UI (gooey nav, spotlight cards, animated hero text) that respects reduced-motion preferences and stays fully static for GitHub Pages. Content lives in content/content.xlsx and is transformed into typed JSON, sitemap, and robots files at build time. Bootstrapped with create-next-app, it uses next/font to load the Geist family, provides structured data (Person JSON-LD), and includes Google Analytics +…"],"features":["Premium presentation: neon accents, glass cards, animated hero/profile card, rotating taglines, logo marquee, scroll-aware text, and responsive layouts for home, experience, projects, certificates, and contact pages.","Static-export ready: output: \"export\", trailing slashes, unoptimized images, .nojekyll, and basePath/assetPrefix injection for GitHub Pages; withBasePath helper prevents broken asset/resume links.","Excel-driven content: a generator reads content/content.xlsx, validates sheets/columns with Zod, splits semicolon lists, enforces booleans/orders, and emits content/generated/content.json, public/sitemap.xml, and…","Recruiter-friendly SEO: OpenGraph/Twitter tags, configurable ogImage, sitemap + robots, canonical URLs built from NEXTPUBLICSITEURL, and Person JSON-LD derived from profile/social links.","Static-friendly contact flow: client validation + honeypot, mailto fallback by default, optional Formspree POST via NEXTPUBLICFORMSPREEENDPOINT, copy-email CTA, and status messaging."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brejeshbalakrishnan/brejeshbalakrishnan.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"df6ff6a14486e8924da749f38b296e5ce38f92acc68a2b6685794d147b1a5290","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.600Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.600Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Premium dark-mode, Excel-driven Next.js portfolio for Brejesh Balakrishnan — neon glass UI, recruiter-ready pages, and static-export hosting on GitHub Pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brejeshbalakrishnan/brejeshbalakrishnan.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"df6ff6a14486e8924da749f38b296e5ce38f92acc68a2b6685794d147b1a5290","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brejeshbalakrishnan/brejeshbalakrishnan.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:16.601Z"},"overvie